OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club secures lease for
OL,4,Anew pitches
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football club is to expand its
OL,7,Ffacilities now that plans for a
OL,8,Flong-term land lease have been
OL,9,Fapproved.
OL,11,FNon-league Moulton FC will be able to
OL,12,Fdevelop new pitches at New Manor Farm
OL,13,Fin the village after West
OL,14,FNorthamptonshire Council agreed to
OL,15,Flease land to the club.
OL,17,FThe plans also include other new
OL,18,Ffacilities and access to a 150-space
OL,19,Fcar park next to the club's existing
OL,20,Fsite.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
