OL,3,GNEWSAFootball club secures lease for
OL,4,Anew pitches
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This will allow the club to support
OL,7,Fthe current and future growth in the
OL,8,Flocal population with new pitches and
OL,9,Fimproved facilities," said club
OL,10,Fchairman Pete Knight.
